Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:07.00,Chinese,C05-12-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}同一个样本，当前军事维护约三点八九金币每月，已经含在完整支出里；
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:07.00,English,C05-12-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1008)}In that same sample, current military maintenance was about 3.89 gold per month,\Nalready included in complete expenditure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.23,0:00:11.26,Chinese,C05-12-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}全部集结情形的当前替代维护约四点八七。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.23,0:00:11.26,English,C05-12-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}The current alternative calculation with all armies raised was about 4.87.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:17.03,Chinese,C05-12-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}两者分别比较，不相加，也不从净收入里再扣一次军费。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:17.03,English,C05-12-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1008)}Compare them separately.\NDo not add them together or subtract military costs from net gold income again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.66,0:00:21.43,Chinese,C05-12-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}全部集结值没有被证明是未来费用上限。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.66,0:00:21.43,English,C05-12-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}The all-raised value has not been proved to be an upper bound on future costs.
